{{!--
    add-wraith-shadow-budget §2/§4 — THE SHADOW AREA.

    A wraith's creation budget is 25 points, not 15. The Shadow is Step Six of every wraith's
    creation and its 10 freebie points are ADDITIONAL to the character's own 15, so a sheet that
    showed only the character's side was misrepresenting the character. This is the Shadow's own
    area: Archetype, Angst, Dark Passions and Thorns in one place, labelled as the Shadow's.

    It is a sibling `sheet-area` of the character's Feature list, not another block inside it. That
    is the point of the requirement's "SHALL NOT render adjacent to the character's own Passions":
    the Dark Passions used to sit in the very next row of the same list as the Passions, which
    invites reading them as one pool.

    The whole area is guarded by `hasshadowarea` (prepareShadowAreaContext), so it is absent on
    every other line — and present, EMPTY, on a freshly imported wraith, which is the normal state
    and therefore the first one to get right.

    NOTHING HERE IS COMPUTED OR ENFORCED. The 10-point pool is NAMED, never tallied: creation
    budgets are the character generator's job and this sheet shows state, not spend history. The
    Dark-Passion ceiling is SHOWN and marked when exceeded, never refused: `wod20-char`'s
    `validate()` evaluates no cross-pool constraint, so a sheet that blocked the excess could make a
    generator-built character un-openable. Permanent Angst is an ordinary editable pool with its
    floor STATED, because the rule is a Storyteller's Willpower roll at difficulty 6 and a sheet
    that computed it would be inventing a result.
--}}
{{#if hasshadowarea}}
<div class="sheet-area flex-columns">

    <div class="headlineRow headlineList splatFont feature-itemlist">
        <div class="largeBox">{{localize "wod.bio.wraith.shadow"}}</div>
    </div>

    {{!-- The second budget, named. `wraith.json` -> `shadow.freebies.total`. --}}
    <div class="information-area">
        {{localize "wod.bio.wraith.shadowfreebies"}}: {{shadowfreebies}}
    </div>

    {{!-- Archetype. Shown here so the Shadow reads as one thing; edited on the Bio tab, where the
          pick against the twelve `shadow-archetype` documents lives. A value the catalog does not
          know prints as itself rather than vanishing. --}}
    <div class="information-area">
        {{localize "wod.bio.wraith.archetype"}}:
        {{#if (ne shadowarchetype "")}}
            {{shadowarchetype}}
        {{else}}
            &mdash;
        {{/if}}
    </div>

    {{!-- Angst, mirrored from its `system.group: "shadow"` Advantage. `SetupDotCounters_v2` runs
          over the whole sheet element in `_onRender`, so this pool is as editable here as it is in
          the Advantages block on the Attributes tab. --}}
    {{#if (gt shadowadvantages.length 0)}}
        {{#each shadowadvantages as |advantage id|}}
            <div class="sheet-boxcontainer">
                {{{getGetStatArea_v2 ../actor advantage}}}
            </div>
        {{/each}}

        <div class="information-area">{{localize "wod.bio.wraith.angstnote"}}</div>
    {{/if}}

    {{!-- Dark Passions, MOVED here from beside the character's own Passions, with the cross-pool
          bound beside them where a GM can see it. --}}
    <div class="headlineGroup splatFont">{{localize "wod.bio.wraith.darkpassions"}}</div>

    <div class="information-area{{#if darkpassionsexceeded}} wod-overbudget{{/if}}">
        {{localize "wod.bio.wraith.darkpassionceiling"}}: {{darkpassiontotal}} / {{passiontotal}}
    </div>

    {{#if (gt darkpassions.length 0)}}
        <div class="feature-itemlistarea">

            {{#each darkpassions as |item id|}}

                {{> "systems/worldofdarkness/templates/actor/parts/feature_item.hbs" actor=../actor item=item locked=../locked edittitle="wod.labels.edit.darkpassion" deletetitle="wod.labels.remove.darkpassion" showtype=true valuefirst=item.system.value}}

            {{/each}}

        </div>
    {{/if}}

    {{!-- Thorns. `valuefirst` like every other dot-rated wraith row: a Thorn costs 1 point per
          level, so its rating is the number that matters. --}}
    <div class="headlineGroup splatFont">{{localize "wod.bio.wraith.thorns"}}</div>

    {{#if (gt thorns.length 0)}}
        <div class="feature-itemlistarea">

            {{#each thorns as |item id|}}

                {{> "systems/worldofdarkness/templates/actor/parts/feature_item.hbs" actor=../actor item=item locked=../locked edittitle="wod.labels.edit.thorn" deletetitle="wod.labels.remove.thorn" showtype=true valuefirst=item.system.value}}

            {{/each}}

        </div>
    {{/if}}

    {{!-- The pre-change free-text Thorns summary, if this wraith has one. Read-only and clearly
          labelled as the legacy field: it is not migrated, and it is not dropped either. --}}
    {{#if (ne legacythorns "")}}
        <div class="information-area">
            {{localize "wod.bio.wraith.legacythorns"}}: {{legacythorns}}
        </div>
    {{/if}}

</div>
{{/if}}
